//     default (ON since her Q33 answer, 2026-10-29 — CPCALOPTIONS): the teacher (or Adrienne) on the student's page in the console, always; the parent on "📅 Our study days" on the parent page
//     only while classes/<cid>/familyDays is true (the switch is on 📅 Pace). Switch off: the parent's card shows the days read-only.
//     The parent PIN (CPDRILLPARENT's) guards the parent's chips once the family has set one.
//   · CLASS MEETINGS: classes/<cid>/meetings/<YYYY-MM-DD> = {what, sec?} (sec = the section Send out offers for that class), edited on 📅 Pace
//     (one targeted update per Save, a path per changed date). Marked on every calendar: a teal dot on ✎ Days off, 🏫 on the two-week strip
