//     (cpctModel's one hook), so the 📝 Tests counts and filter, "No core card covers it", the item analysis and 💡 all read them.
//     🔗 Check the links (her question, opened): the matched cards ticked, a search of the section's fronts to tick more, Save → the item's
//     `cards` on the class's test layer, in the same ONE update of classTests/<cid>/<section>/<form> as every 📝 Tests change (the item's
