// CPCARDSSEE_START — 📚 THE CARDS BROWSER, read-only (DESIGN_class_platform_2026-10-28.md §6.0, §6.1, §8.4, §13 row 9, §15; PR 9 of the class
// platform). Her words 2026-10-28: "super easy for her to quickly go through and see all the questions and the answers, or the front or the
// back … not look like a huge amount, so things need to collapse … naturally collapsed unless she opens them, and then if she moves on,
// collapse it back" — "a very important feature". The look is the agreed mockup, ~/Desktop/Envirothon/MOCKUP_teacher_browser.html (📚 Cards).
// INERT unless ENVCONSOLE's envcOn() (the Envirothon site, a teacher or admin login): Howe, DeWalt and Burris never reach a line of it, and
