//   · THE CARDS — every unit attached to the class (CPUNIT's cpuAttached), from its compiled file through HoweUnits (cpuLoad: NC Envirothon =
//     envirothon.js, loaded on demand the first time 📚 Cards opens). The demo file carries a browse-only copy (window.HoweUnitsDemo, written
