// ── ＋ QUICK ADD (her words 2026-10-28: "quickly go to terms and quickly type things in … if I type it in, quickly goes, doesn't keep it in
//    there, it blanks it out, says maybe at the bottom, hey, it's done. And then you can add more and more and more" · "a little plus button …
//    pick like the T or the F or the I … if there is any more subcategories … an option to pick which one"). ONE panel, opened by ＋ on any
//    folder header (station, Key Concept, ID, item) or ＋ Add a card here at a folder's end, pre-set to that place: T / F / I (only the decks
//    the section has) and the subcategory (the folder she tapped first). Enter in the front goes to the back, Enter in the back adds; the
//    fields blank, the cursor goes back to the front, the note says "✓ Added …" with Undo, and the panel stays open for the next one.
//    📋 Paste a list: one card per line (Term — definition · Term: definition · Term<Tab>definition), a preview with a tick per line and the
