// CPSEND_START — 📤 SEND OUT BY SECTION, DECK OR KEY CONCEPT: to all or picked students, now or on a date (DESIGN_class_platform_2026-10-28.md
// §6.8, §5.1, §8.3, §9, §13 row 31; PR 31 of the class platform). Her words 2026-10-28: "sending out like one subcategory at a time. Like
// maybe the biosphere or the water cycle or photosynthesis and respiration … it could look like the card cycle and you can maybe even do it
// on that and just have a thing that says send out to all kids … or send out to individual kid for each of these little subcategories or
