// INERT unless the class site (ENVSITE's envSiteOn): Howe, DeWalt and Burris never reach a line that does anything, and Lincoln's
// Envirothon in Howe keeps today's behaviour exactly — his mirror skips Key Concept keys and scheduled records until her yes on Q52
// (cpsdRelease returns null off the site, so ENVMIRROR's own code runs, and it ignores a key it doesn't know).
//   · THREE LEVELS, ONE KEY SHAPE (§6.8.1): a section (`soils`), a deck (`Soils and Land Use · Terms`) — both as today — or a Key Concept,
