//     (now / a date and time in the CLASS's time zone, ⚡ the next class meeting when the class has meetings), what's already out.
//   · NOW = today's write with the new key form: ONE multi-path update of release/<cid>/all/<key> (or students/<sid>/<key>) =
//     {openedAt, by, level}. ON A DATE = ONE record per key at release/<cid>/scheduled/<id> = {key, level, to:"all"|{<sid>:true}, on, at,
