// CPITEMTRIANGLE_START — 📐 THE SOIL TEXTURE TRIANGLE: the `chart` skill item type (DESIGN_class_platform_2026-10-28.md §4.1b, §13 rows
// 25–27; RESEARCH_envirothon_skills_2026-10-28.md §4.1, ranked #4 in §5 — "a sure question every year, learned in about a week"; §8.1 the
