//   · THE CHART is drawn here as inline SVG (no image file): the 10% grid in all three directions, the class outlines and names, the ticks
//     on each side slanted the way their lines run, and the side titles with the way the numbers grow — phone-first at 430 px.
//   · A TRY: a NEW soil each time — a random point inside a class (sand + silt + clay = 100, whole percents, mostly 5s like the tests, 3% or
