//     👀 Watch it: the clay line, then the silt and sand lines with the dot, then the class lights up · ✍️ Finish it: the lines are drawn and
//     she names the class, then ONE line is drawn (clay) and she puts the dot and names it (the research's faded step) · 💪 On your own.
//     Her taps are drawn where she tapped (no snapping, no readout), so the chart never tells her she is right before Check.
//   · WHICH STEP WAS MISSED: "axis:<clay|silt|sand>" — followed that line the wrong way (her tap is on the line that leaves the same tick in
