//   · NOT BUILT (the research gives them other types or the field day, and says keep the scope): the clinometer, the prism, pacing, the
//     site-index graph, rings, the d-tape, board feet. Another `scale` kind (a ruler, a thermometer) registers through CPSC_PREV.
//   · 📅 Pace's "skills learned" line counts it from summary.skills like any other; CPSK_COST adds its minutes. No new cards; its
//     `replaces` (Forestry · Facts #o446, #o447, #o448, the research's §8.1 list for the stick) waits for ✂️ Trim (PR 27).
//   · THE DEMO (cpScaleDemoSeed, envsDemoStart's guarded line): the unit's Biltmore stick beside the other skills, and the classmates'
