//     the test questions it's on, whose weak list it is in, ＋ Add to review list.
//   · 🧭 WHAT THEY'RE STRUGGLING WITH, by Key Concept (or by item, for an item deck): the missed questions (through their linked cards) plus
//     the weak cards, each row tied to the pace (§8.2): "Behind on cards — 41% of its core learned" when under CPM_BEHIND (60%) of it is
//     learned across the students who have the section (check 📅 Pace before reteaching), else "Learned the cards (74%) — still missing it"
//     (the one to review in class). Learned = the summary's byConcept mastered ÷ total for that Key Concept (the mirror's own counters,
