const CPDR_MEANS_HANDOFF="Where a card goes to the parent’s drill when a parent takes a student’s reviews over (\u{1F9E0} on the parent page); otherwise every review stays in the \u{1F33F} sitting. A card counts as learned for the final at its section’s level (Every 2 weeks unless the section plan says otherwise).";
