// CPDRILLTEACHER_START — 🧠 THE TEACHER DRILLS 3–5 OF EACH STUDENT'S CARDS IN CLASS, and the student's own app books them forward
// (DESIGN_class_platform_2026-10-28.md §7(b), §9, §12, §13 row 14, §14 Q13/Q14; PR 14 of the class platform). Which cards: the design's
// pick for Q13 (2026-10-28), "due today, most-missed first". For Lincoln, her yes to Q14 (2026-10-28): "I would definitely love for the
// teacher grade drills for Lincoln to be sent to me so I can keep an eye on where he's at." That is PR L3, later; this PR only makes the
// drill record complete enough for it (who, when, which card, the grade). INERT unless the class site is on: every function returns at once
// for Howe, DeWalt and Burris (no edition), and nothing is read or written for Lincoln.
